      "created_at": "2025-08-27T05:30:24.778Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/nsuregrowth\">@Nsuregrowth</a></p>\n<p>Principally debiting control paybale account for advance to creditor is wrong for which ERPNext can offer you a solution by defining Advance settings in company doctype as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/e/3ee7d7d598d30db573c9deb1db988d73d142031a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3ee7d7d598d30db573c9deb1db988d73d142031a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/e/3ee7d7d598d30db573c9deb1db988d73d142031a_2_690x336.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8Yuk8f5wD3x3k02qbQtHCYrhYiC\" width=\"690\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/e/3ee7d7d598d30db573c9deb1db988d73d142031a_2_690x336.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/e/3ee7d7d598d30db573c9deb1db988d73d142031a_2_1035x504.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/e/3ee7d7d598d30db573c9deb1db988d73d142031a_2_1380x672.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F7EF\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1862×909 95.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
